{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48988","headline":"牡丹落後有作 · 孙鲂","name":"牡丹落後有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"未发先愁有一朝，如今零落更魂销。\n青丛别後无多色，红线穿来已半焦。\n蓄恨绮罗犹眷眷，薄情蜂蝶去飘飘。\n明年虽道还期在，争奈凭栏乍寂寥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙鲂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}